---
const ACCENT = "#7E1E1E";
---

<section class="relative overflow-hidden bg-[#FBFAF7]">
  <div class="mx-auto grid w-full max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 py-10 lg:grid-cols-[1.05fr_.95fr] lg:py-14">
    <div class="flex flex-col justify-center">
      <p class="inline-flex w-fit items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-700">
        Lloret de Mar · Tapas · Bocatas · Hamburguesas
      </p>

      <h1 class="mt-5 text-4xl font-black tracking-tight sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
        <span class="text-zinc-900">BAR</span>{" "}
        <span class="text-[color:var(--accent)]" style={`--accent:${ACCENT}`}>
          ARCADIA
        </span>
      </h1>

      <p class="mt-4 max-w-xl text-base text-zinc-700 sm:text-lg">
        Pide a domicilio o para recoger. Personaliza tus bocatas, hamburguesas y
        wraps como en las grandes cadenas — pero con sabor de casa.
      </p>

      <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
        <a
          href="/carta"
          class="rounded-2xl bg-[color:var(--accent)] px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-white shadow-sm hover:opacity-95"
          style={`--accent:${ACCENT}`}
        >
          Pedir ahora
        </a>
        <a
          href="/carta"
          class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-zinc-900 hover:bg-zinc-50"
        >
          Ver carta
        </a>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-7 flex flex-wrap gap-2 text-xs text-zinc-600">
        <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-3 py-1">Sin registro obligatorio</span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-3 py-1">Favoritos + historial</span>
        <span class="rounded-full border border-zinc-200 bg-white px-3 py-1">Delivery con horario</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* “Imagen”/bloque visual (placeholder bonito). Si luego quieres foto real, lo cambiamos. */}
    <div class="relative">
      <div class="relative h-80 w-full overflow-hidden rounded-4xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white shadow-sm sm:h-95 lg:h-105">
        <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top,rgba(126,30,30,0.20),transparent_60%)]" />
        <div class="absolute -right-20 -top-24 h-72 w-72 rounded-full bg-(--accent)/10" style={`--accent:${ACCENT}`} />
        <div class="absolute -bottom-20 -left-24 h-80 w-80 rounded-full bg-zinc-900/5" />

        <div class="relative flex h-full flex-col justify-end p-6">
          <div class="rounded-2xl border border-zinc-200 bg-white/90 p-4 backdrop-blur">
            <div class="text-sm font-black tracking-tight">Sugerencia de hoy</div>
            <div class="mt-1 text-xs text-zinc-600">
              (Aquí irá una foto real y platos destacados)
            </div>
            <div class="mt-3 flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="rounded-xl bg-zinc-900 px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-white">
                Tapas & Bocatas
              </span>
              <span class="rounded-xl border border-zinc-300 bg-white px-3 py-1 text-xs font-bold text-zinc-900">
                Menú mediodía
              </span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="mt-4 text-[10px] text-zinc-500">
            * Sustituiremos este bloque por una imagen/hero real cuando quieras.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
